/* Hea Tamaneru the Aun Hunter - North camp hunter (Aun), marae-hunt.
 * Gives one random Aun species of the North zone, 50 kills; minimum level 200;
 * reward 800,000,000 XP (AwardNoShareXP) + 200,000 Luminance; 20 h cooldown from the claim
 * (MaraeHuntNorthAunWait). Skin cloned from 1003211 Hea Camauri the Barkeep (Setup, palette, clothing, stats; never its emotes,
 * generators, books, spells, positions or hand items). Wields Chimeric Atlatl of the Quiddity (1004712).
 * Gender (dialogue/design only - Hea Tumerok weenies carry no gender property): Male. Skins were drawn without regard to gender; swap the template if one reads wrong in game. */

